      },
      "tags": [
        "latin",
        "glyf",
        "kern-only",
        "small"
      ],
      "notes": "Jellee Roman 1.000 (Alfredo Marco Pradil, OFL-1.1 with Reserved Font Name, as its name table states), a real font used by HarfBuzz's in-house kern-format2.tests. Its only positioning is a legacy `kern` table: no GPOS, no GSUB. The table uses the Apple header (version 1.0, three subtables: one format 0 with a single pair, two format 2 class tables), not the Microsoft version 0 header.",
      "verified": true
    },
